            "notes": "This is where the build starts coming together. \n\n [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) is a big help for our movement. A dash reset after Updraft gives you a big repositioning opportunity or a quick escape.  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is again a big help for [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424). Not only does it reduce cooldowns, but it also gives overhealth after using an ability.\n\n [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) provides more weapon power, and it reduces cooldowns.",
